{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":false,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":false,"protected_values":false,"translated":true},"context":"amerikaner-card-game UI copy.details","detected_language":"zh","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"amerikaner-card-game.copy.details","keys":["amerikaner-card-game.copy.details"],"locale":"zh-TW","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"這個本地版本遵循挪威美國人規則,並與Norske kortspill比較。 它支援3到6個玩家,使用標準的套牌,沒有小丑。 為了平均分配牌,一、兩或四張2將被留給3、5或6個玩家;四個玩家使用所有的ZXQPH0000QXZ牌。 莊家左邊的玩家首先下注。 一般下注必須至少是您手牌的一半,並且高於當前的下注;您也可以過牌或跟注美國人,單獨嘗試每個招式,而無需配對或王牌。 如果您贏得一般下注,領先第一張牌設定王牌,並要求一張不在您手中的那種花色的牌。 持有者必須在第一個招式中玩它,併成為您的配對。 如果對手手中沒有相同的牌,則繼續無配對;只有宣佈者作為出價者獲得分數。 玩家必須儘可能地","record_id":"a7da0ccea21a2567f3c3ae0d19a623302ddd52cb9f0596921c934488ca065c3d","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.6448424248749944,"source":"This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"40ea37c675154fede4e50d8929d493265a637c4a89c7821fd0dac57879caea3a","status":"needs-review","translation":"這個本地版本遵循挪威美國人規則,並與Norske kortspill比較。 它支援3到6個玩家,使用標準的套牌,沒有小丑。 為了平均分配牌,一、兩或四張2將被留給3、5或6個玩家;四個玩家使用所有的ZXQPH0000QXZ牌。 莊家左邊的玩家首先下注。 一般下注必須至少是您手牌的一半,並且高於當前的下注;您也可以過牌或跟注美國人,單獨嘗試每個招式,而無需配對或王牌。 如果您贏得一般下注,領先第一張牌設定王牌,並要求一張不在您手中的那種花色的牌。 持有者必須在第一個招式中玩它,併成為您的配對。 如果對手手中沒有相同的牌,則繼續無配對;只有宣佈者作為出價者獲得分數。 玩家必須儘可能地","truncated":true,"warnings":["length_ratio"]}
